7	 *   section hatch, condensed all-caps annotation tracked wide, a ruled notes column
8	 *   down the left and a title block across the foot. Baylor gold is spent once, on the
9	 *   typical-error dimension. Recognisable with every word removed.
10	 * STORY: the room sees a dimensioned zone before it sees a claim; understands that a
11	 *   reading inside it is not an observation; and leaves knowing the second line — the
12	 *   threshold — is drawn dashed because a person sets it.
